label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	Danilo: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}

if {Transaction_Chapter} == 0.0:
	# Chapter 1 — "Front-Row Snacks" (snack | 0 tallies — Normal tambay + 1 uncanny sight breadcrumb)
	Danilo: Uy, boss. I like the view. Best shade on the whole road. This here's my best view.
	Danilo: Name is Danilo. Figured I should buy [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] so I look like a paying regular.
	Danilo: Funny sight two blocks down, by the way. That tall horse guy just walked past the same mango tree four times.
	- Best view on the road, huh?
		Danilo: See? You get it. Front-row seat to Karimlan, plus crunchy snacks.
	- You saw two blocks past the bend?
		Danilo: I've got good eyesight, boss. Lots of carrots. Don't overthink it.
	- Long as you pay for snacks.
		Danilo: Fair enough! Coins right here, boss. Pass over [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 1.0:
	# Chapter 2 — "Girl by the Guardrail" (bottle / snack | Inflection #1: +1 / +1 / -1)
	[signal arg="flag:danilo_saw_rosalyn=true"]
	Danilo: Psst, boss. Saw a quiet floating girl in a tattered white dress out by the highway waiting shed earlier.
	Danilo: She reached out to steady herself on the guardrail, and her fingers passed straight through the metal.
	Danilo: Poor gal. I pretended not to see her though. Way above a snacking tambay's pay grade, boss. 
	- Wait, you spotted that from here?
		[signal arg="tally:+1"]
		Danilo: Lucky angle through the mist, boss. Just be gentle if she wanders under your bulb, ha?
	- Sounds like you actually care, Danilo.
		[signal arg="tally:+1"]
		Danilo: Relax, boss, do not start rumors. I just hate watching someone walk the same road in circles.
	- Not our problem if she lingers.
		[signal arg="tally:-1"]
		Danilo: Cold, boss. Guess I am not the only one staying off the clock.
	Danilo: Anyway, pass over [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]. Watching the street works up a thirst.

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 2.0:
	# Chapter 3 — "Fluorescent Glare" (sachet -> allow_sub_cat:bottle | Inflection #2 — Earned Daligmata slip!)
	Danilo: Ow. Your storefront bulb is brutal, boss. Pounding straight behind my temples.
	Danilo: Hard to catch a break when you cannot shut all your eyes at once.
	Danilo: Uh, figure of speech! Cheap coffee talking. Saw that former professor by the creek checking his own pulse like finals week.
	Danilo: Hand over [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], boss. Need something to wake up.
	- [Swap to cold water for his headache.]
		[signal arg="allow_sub_cat:bottle"]
		Danilo: Appreciate it, boss. Slide it over quick before the glare gets worse.
	- Your secret is safe here, Danilo.
		[signal arg="flag:danilo_eyes_known=true"]
		[signal arg="tally:+1"]
		Danilo: Hah. Most people freak out at a slip like that. Keep the extra-eyes talk between us, boss.
	- Wait, what did you just say?!
		[signal arg="tally:-1"]
		Danilo: Relax, boss, bad joke. Just pass my order so I can sit in the shade.

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 3.0:
	# Chapter 4 — "Clocking Back In" (snack | Inflection #3: +2 / +1 / -1)
	if {Flag_DaniloEyesKnown}:
		Danilo: I know that look, boss. You want me to look past the highway bend for that floating girl.
	else:
		Danilo: Alright, boss, no point hiding it anymore. I am a Daligmata. I have eyes that see past the veil.
		Danilo: And I know that look. You want me to trace where that floating girl by the shed belongs.
	Danilo: That former professor by the creek has the prayers, sure, except mortal eyes cannot follow a soul across towns.
	Danilo: Opening full Daligmata sight hits like staring straight at welding sparks, boss. Gives me a brutal migraine.
	if {Flag_DaniloEyesKnown} or {Flag_BrahimLanternWard}:
		- Pair your sight with Brahim's lantern.
			[signal arg="flag:danilo_traced_tether=true"]
			[signal arg="tally:+2"]
			Danilo: Hah! A healer and a Daligmata working together, old-school style. Fine, boss, you win. I am clocking back in.
		- Just one look for her, Danilo.
			[signal arg="flag:danilo_traced_tether=true"]
			[signal arg="tally:+1"]
			Danilo: You fight dirty with that quiet stare, boss. Fine. One quick look past the bend, then straight back to my bench.
		- Stay on break then, boss.
			[signal arg="tally:-1"]
			Danilo: Appreciate the out, boss. Still feels a little heavy leaving her out there, honestly.
	else:
		- Just one look for her, Danilo.
			[signal arg="flag:danilo_traced_tether=true"]
			[signal arg="tally:+1"]
			Danilo: You fight dirty with that quiet stare, boss. Fine. One quick look past the bend, then straight back to my bench.
		- Stay on break then, boss.
			[signal arg="tally:-1"]
			Danilo: Appreciate the out, boss. Still feels a little heavy leaving her out there, honestly.
	Danilo: Pass over [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] first. Not doing soul-tracking on an empty stomach.

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 4.0:
	# Chapter 5 — "Welding Sparks" (bottle | 0 tallies — Ten Payoff!)
	if {Flag_DaniloTracedTether}:
		Danilo: Pass me cold [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], boss. My forehead feels like I stared into welding sparks for an hour.
		Danilo: Worth it, though. Followed her silver thread two towns past the creek bridge.
		Danilo: Found a young schoolteacher named Lia lighting a white church candle beside a framed photo and menthol candy.
		Danilo: Tell the floating girl in the tattered white dress nobody is shivering under that shed waiting for her anymore.
		- Thank you, Danilo. Truly.
			Danilo: Relax, boss, do not get mushy on me. Just glad my eyes were good for something.
		- Go rest your eyes after this.
			Danilo: Way ahead of you. Cold bottle on the brow and zero street-watching for an hour.
	else:
		Danilo: Just grabbing [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], boss.
		Danilo: Kept glancing down toward the highway waiting shed anyway. My "off the clock" excuse feels pretty thin lately.
		- Never too late to care, Danilo.
			Danilo: Yeah. Maybe I will stop hiding behind jokes next time somebody needs a hand.
		- Take it easy, boss.
			Danilo: Always do, boss. Catch you from the shade.

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 5.0:
	# Chapter 6 — "Eyes on Your Corner" (snack / can | Accumulated Tally Resolution!)
	Danilo: Highway bend is finally quiet, boss. Weird how calm the road looks once a lost soul gets her answer.
	if {Flag_DaniloTracedTether} and {Transaction_Tally} >= 3.0:
		[signal arg="outcome:watchful_ally"]
		Danilo: Best part? I actually shut my eyes and slept five straight hours without a headache. First time in years.
		Danilo: Your counter did that, boss. When the Queen of Biringan weighs your ledger, every eye I have backs this shop.
	elif {Transaction_Tally} >= 1.0:
		[signal arg="outcome:bench_regular"]
		Danilo: Best awning shade and best snacks in Karimlan. I am keeping friendly watch on your corner, boss.
	else:
		[signal arg="outcome:distant_eyes"]
		Danilo: Exact coins ready, boss. Keeping things simple and staying out of everyone's business.
	Danilo: Pass over [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] when you get a second.

[end_timeline]

label Talk
Danilo: No rush, boss. Just waiting on [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
- Out of stock right now, Danilo.
	Danilo: Sayang. I will grab a bench spot and catch you after Mario restocks.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
- Grabbing it right now!
	Danilo: Solid, boss. I am not going anywhere.
[end_timeline]

label Partial
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	Danilo: Nice one, boss. Still missing [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] though.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	Danilo: Got that! Just pass over [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] too.
else:
	Danilo: Halfway there, boss. Still need [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
[end_timeline]

label SubstituteItem
[signal arg="flag:danilo_eyes_known=true"]
[signal arg="tally:+1"]
Danilo: Hold on. I asked for coffee, and you slid me ice-cold [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_SubstituteItemName}[/color]?
Danilo: Ah, pressing that against my forehead actually kills the glare. Nobody ever looks out for the watcher, boss.
Danilo: Alright, you caught me. A Daligmata sees too much, and bright bulbs hit every single eye at once. Keep it quiet, ha?
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_StoryGouged}:
	Danilo: Brave markup, boss! Paying anyway, though I saw that price jump from a block away.
else:
	if {Global_TipActive} == 1.0:
		Danilo: Keep the extra coins, boss. Worth it for the front-row shade.
	else:
		Danilo: Solid, boss. Salamat! Back to my corner post.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
Danilo: Easy, boss. My eyes might be tired, not blind. I asked for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
[end_timeline]
